window.products.push({"id":71624,"name":"Dryer Repair Kit Is Compatible with Samsung Dc97-16782A Drum Support Roll, 6602-001655 Tension Belt, Dc93-00634A Idler Pulley Replacement Ap5325135 Ap","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iCs735hFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Replace the kit : 4 x DC97-16782A Dryer Roller, 1 x 6602-001655 Idler Belt and 1 x DC93-00634A Idler(include 1pc screw) This Dryer Repair kit is for Samsung Dryer, Kenmore Dryer Fixes the following symptoms: Dryer does not tumble Dryer does Not Start Dryer makes Noise DC97-16782A Dryer Drum Support Roller and Axle, which includes the roller shaft and mounting clips, is used in dryers. This part holds the drum as it rotates on the support wheels. When the roller begins to wear out, it self lubricates, so no additional grease is needed. If your dryer is making odd noises, then checking and replacing the rollers can be the solution to your problem. Make sure to unplug the dryer from the power source before beginning this replacement. DC93-00634A Dryer Idler Pulley includes the idler arm and the idler pulley that maintain tension on the drive belt, allowing the belt to turn. Disconnect the power before installing this part. Please wear working gloves to protect your hands. 6602-001655 Dryer Drum Belt attaches to the motor pulley and causes the drum to spin as the motor is rotating. The drum belt is made of black rubber. This is an easy repair and would only take a few minutes. This goes between the drive motor and the dryer drum. The belt may have broken, which will cause the drum to not turn properly. You will need to pull your dryer away from the wall and use your Phillips screwdriver to remove the screws on the back. Please note: These products are not Samsung original products; Indication of Samsung and any related model designation above is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility. It can work on almost Samsung dryer,you can send us dryer models,we can help you to confirm it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71iCs735hFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cattiry","source_asin":"B07PXZ8NHC","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-71624","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PXZ8NHC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PXZ8NHC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
