window.products.push({"id":71697,"name":"Compact Laundry Dryer, 1400W Electric Portable Clothes Dryer, 9LBS Laundry Dryer, Premium Compact Tumbler Stainless Steel Laundry Dryer with Exhaust P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C6anAoulL._AC_.jpg","description":"POWERFUL DRYING PERFORMANCE: Upgraded stainless steel tumbler design and 1400W power can reach temperatures up to 149 degrees! Accelerates drying, automatically stops when clothes are dry, saving electricity bills. With a generous 2.6 cubic feet of capacity, the dryer can dry up to 13 pounds of laundry (wet), making it nearly enough for the entire family. For quick drying clothes, we recommend no more than 10 pounds of clothing at a time. COMPACT DRYER: This mini dryer is a great addition to small living spaces like dorms, apartments, and RVs. The device measures ‎23.6 x 17.1 x 27.5 inches, 48.4LBS wight and comes with a mobile carrying handle for easy mobility. A true space saver, it can be freestanding, rack mounted, wall mounted or stacked. No matter how big your home is, there's always a space or nook for this portable dryer to fit perfectly. SILENT DESIGN: Reduce distractions with a quiet tumbling infrastructure experience, allowing you to run the dryer while you sleep or go about your daily work without excessive noise. Low noise: 58-62dB. So please don't worry, it won't affect your normal conversation and sleep. FORWARD AND REVERSE ACTION: This portable clothes dryer has a large diameter stainless steel turning function and a special internal physical structure, which can provide the best drying experience. These features ensure enough spin to prevent tangles, remove wrinkles and keep your clothes fluffy and comfortable. The efficient two-way flip function also helps save energy and reduce drying time. EASY TO USE: Our compact dryer is equipped with a liquid crystal display (LCD) and has four drying modes: 1. Powerful: Dries larger items quickly. 2. Smart: This smart mode will automatically adjust the drying time according to the humidity. 3.ECO: Deodorize any clothes, dry small clothes 4.normal: More suitable for clothes that need ironing or drying of small clothes. The control panel is easy to understand and operate (even for the elderly).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41C6anAoulL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Codesfir","source_asin":"B0B1TXLLY7","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-71697","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B1TXLLY7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B1TXLLY7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
