window.products.push({"id":71709,"name":"The Laundry Alternative PuriFI - Portable Small Washer for Apartment & RV - Combo Diaper Washer & Automatic Clothes Washing Machine - Best Rated Quiet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zZMwN1v0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"With self-heated intensive hot water technology and high-tech patent pending process specifically designed to wash diapers, The PuriFI washing machine is the only washer in the world that can wash cloth diapers sparkling clean with no need for any sort of pre-treatment.Â Comes with a built-in internal heater (optional usage), Heat water to 158 degrees. Superior rinse. 2 full deep rinses + 2 spray rinses. Many washers today only have 2 spray rinses.Â Drum and impeller are made from high quality, thick stainless steel that can withstand high temperatures. Fully portable, hooks up to a standard kitchen or bathroom faucet.Â Very quiet, only 34 decibels. The quietest portable, fully automatic washer on the market.Â No more annoying end of cycle music/sounds. One quick beep that is similar to a microwave sound.Â Why Wash ClothDiapers? Save Money & the Environment! Save up to $3000Â per childon disposable diaper costs! This washer quickly pays for itself, and we even have monthly installment plans of up to 6 months available.Â An estimated 27.4 BILLIONdisposable diapers are used per year in the USA alone. Per the EPA an estimated 3.3 million TONSof diaposable diapers go into landfills each year in the USA alone. Disposable diapers take 500 years to biodegrade! Natural cloth diapers are gentler on the skin than plastic diapers.Â 10 Cycles: Normal Wash Heavy Duty Quick Cycle Normal Wash 120F Diaper MagicÂ Intensive Hot Gentle/Wool Rinse & Spin Spin Only Self-Clean Wash capacity: 7.0 Lbs.Â Dimensions: 16.5\" x 15\" x 28.5\" Weight: 42 lbs.Â 800 RPM Spin Cycle Drum dimensions 11.5\" x 11.5\" diameter x height Uses 250 watts except when heating element is on, when on, uses 1500 watts.Â","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41zZMwN1v0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Laundry Alternative","source_asin":"B09N8NXR35","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-71709","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N8NXR35","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N8NXR35","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
