window.products.push({"id":71780,"name":"(5 pieces) DC47-00019A Dryer Heating Element for Samsung Dryer, DC96-00887A and DC47-00016A Thermal Fuse, DC47-00018A Thermostat and DC32-00007A Therm","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OdL3CtgEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DC47-00019A: The Samsung dryer heating element DC47-00019A contains high-quality materials (nickel-chromium content 95%) to provide better thermal energy and insulated ceramic bracket supporting heating wire to use longer. Replace: 35001247, 35001119, AP4045884, 1185561, AH2038533, EA2038533, PS2038533, ERDC47-00019ADC96-00887A: Thermal fuse with bracket. When the dryer is overheated, the thermal breaker DC96-00887A starts to work and the heating element will be turned off. Replace: PS2038484 and AP4207819DC47-00016A: The thermal fuse is used to cut off the power when the dryer is over heated. If the thermal fuse blows, the dryer won't start. If this thermal fuse blowns out and must be replaced.Replace: AP4201894 and PS2038378DC47-00018A: The thermostat has a limit of 260°F and a differential of 50 degrees. And the heating element will cut out at 260 degrees and cycle back on once the internal temperature drops by 50 degrees.Replace: PS2038383, AP4201898, AP4201899 and 35001092DC32-00007A: A thermistor is attached to the blower housing and regulates the temperature in your dryer. When it stops working, your dryer won't dry your clothes properly.Replace: PS4204984 and AP4201716These products are not Samsung original products; Indication of Samsung and any related model designation is made solely for purposes of demonstrating compatibility. TIPS: 1. Cut off the power supply of the dryer before installation.2. Wear gloves during installation to protect your hands.3. Clean the accumulations inside the dryer vent. The accumulations are full of bacteria and easily cause fire. 4. Watching YouTube video make the installation easier. Package included: 1 x DC47-00019A Heating elements for dryers, 1 x DC96-00887A Dryer thermal fuse, 1 x DC47-00016A Dryer thermal fuse, 1 x DC47-00018A Thermostat, 1 x DC32-00007A Dryer thermistor.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71OdL3CtgEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Gxcdizx","source_asin":"B08JHR44MV","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-71780","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JHR44MV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JHR44MV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
