window.products.push({"id":71786,"name":"8Pcs 00618112 00637940 Rubber Grate Feet Part by Beaquicy - Replacement for Thermador, Bos-ch Gas Range/Cooktop - Replaces 00617174, 617174, 00618112,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.77,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UtoNlz+zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Rubber ✅【8 PACK】-- 00637940 00618112 Thermador Rubber Grate Feet are for range. The rubber feet for cooktop grate are attached to the bottom of the burner grate to prevent the cooktop from being scratched. Each support shelf foot of the grate needs to be installed so that your grate remains balanced. Worn or missing burner feet can cause scratches on your gas hob and spoil the look of your hob. The package includes 8 x grate feet. The product measures 0.4 inches in diameter and 0.35 inches in height. ✅ 【RUBBER MATERIAL】-- The 8 Pack 00637940 Bosch Grate Feet are made of high quality rubber material. The high quality material allows the rubber feet to fit the grate better, they are easy to install and do not come off easily. The product will keep your grate level and your cookware level when cooking on the cooktop, allowing for even cooking. ►A pack of 8 rubber feet will satisfy your need for multiple replacements and is also less expensive than buying Individual pack. ✅【COMPATIBILITY】-- 00637940 Rubber Grate Feet replacement for Ther-mador, Bos-ch Range. ►Replace: 00618112 1999626, 617174, 618112, AH3478553, EA3478553, PS3478553. ►Compatible: PRD486GDHC/01, PRD486GDHC/03, PRD486GDHC/04, PRD486GDHC/05, PRD486GDHC/06, PRD486GDHC/07, PRD486GDHC/08, PRD486GDHC/09, HDI8054U/05, HDI8054U/06, HDIP054U/01, HGI8054UC/04, HGI8054UC/05, HGI8054UC/06, HGIP054UC/01, NGM5055UC/01, NGM8065UC/01, NGM8065UC/02, NGMP055UC/01, NGMP055UC/02, NGM5624UC/03, NGM5655UC/01, etc. ✅【90 DAYS WARRANTY】-- The 00618112 00637940 Thermador Grate Feet support 90 DAYS return and exchange. ►Grate rubber feet protect the hob and balance the hob and cookware. Worn or missing feet will not only scratch the surface of your hob and spoil the aesthetics of your cooktop. It can also leave your grate without proper leveling, causing pots to tilt and cook unevenly, resulting in unsafe cooking. the value pack of 8 is enough to fit one of each foot on each grate. ✅【EASY INSTALLATION】-- The installation of 00618112 00637940 Rubber Grate Feet are simple. You need to turn the grate over, pull off the old legs and place the new rubber feet on the grate supports. Afterwards place the grate on a flat surface, making sure that it is level and does not wobble. The new rubber feet may be a little tight when fitting and require a little force to fit. NOTE: When installing, wait until the surface of the cooktop and grate has cooled down to avoid burns.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61UtoNlz+zL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B085G747BK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-71786","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085G747BK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B085G747BK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
